'''Medu-san''' (マデューさん, ''Madū-san'') is an [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] variant of [[Mr. Mer]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. She was added in [[Version 10.10 Update|Version 10.10]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Medu-san
|image = E 583.png
|money drop = 1,000¢ - 3,950¢
|first appearance = [[Aku Studies 401: Inquiry]]
'''UL''': [[Breathtaking Waves|Sub-chapter 40 - Breathtaking Waves]]
|latest appearance = '''ZL:''' [[Yogurt Archipelago|Sub-chapter 12 - Yogurt Archipelago]]
}}

==Enemy==
In terms of health, damage and range, Medu-san is actually weaker than her [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] counterpart. Even her Lv.1 [[Surge Attack]] doesn't allow her to reach any farther than Mr. Mer with his [[Mini-Wave]]s.

==Strategy==
Medu-san be treated similarly to [[Wicked Tank Cat (Enemy)|Wicked Tank Cat]]. She has 20 less range than Mr. Mer, leaving her open to being frozen by a [[Talents|Talented]] [[Gardener Cat (Rare Cat)|Weedwacker Cat]], though you may additionally have to unlock Resist Surge for him to stand a chance against her. Other options include fully [[:Category:Cats with Surge Immunity|Surge-immune Cats]] such as Talented [[Boogie Cat (Special Cat)|Gato Amigo]] as a meatshield and Talented [[Li'l Lizard Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l King Dragon]] or [[Actress Cat (Special Cat)|Beefcake Cat]] as an attacker. Even Cats that can outrange Medu-san's regular attacks can still potentially get hit by a Surge depending on where it spawns.

